<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average was unchanged at 6,521.70.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1,270 to 1200.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite index fell 0.29 point to 398.14.</p>
<p>The average price per share lost 3 cents.</p>
<p>Volume was 412,499,170, compared with 149,840,350 Friday in an abbreviated session.</p>
